# Engine (Rust) Conventions

## Module layout
- `project_state/` — types, validation, mutations
- `persistence/` — SQLite, autosave, recovery (Phase 1)
- `event_bus/` — typed events, subscribers
- `error/` — `CinemaError` unified error type

## Patterns
```rust
// ✅ State mutation via manager
manager.apply(Mutation::AddClip { ... })?;

// ❌ Direct timeline manipulation from outside project_state
timeline.clips.push(clip);
```

## Errors
Use `thiserror` + `Result<T, CinemaError>`. Never panic in library code.

## Serialization
All public types: `Serialize` + `Deserialize`. Match `docs/PROJECT_STATE.schema.json`.

## Tests
- Unit tests colocated in same file (`#[cfg(test)]`)
- Integration tests in `engine/tests/`
- Persistence tests must include recovery scenarios

## Performance
- Avoid allocations in hot paths (playback, scrub)
- Use `Arc` for shared read-only state
- Document perf budget if adding new hot-path code
